  "comments": "According to a post-colophon annotation, copied from a \"master exemplar\" (reading \"phyag dpe dngos las bris\" for \"phyag dpe dngos la bris\") - i.e., (ID: 5856) or a copy of it - or itself constituting the master exemplar.\r\nThe part entitled \"bslab btus kyi bsgom don dpe'i khrid zab po\" covers fols. 1b1-2b1, and the part entitled \"spyod 'jug 'khro lo ta bu zab lam bsgom pa\" covers fol. 2b1-7b2.",
